l9t5_canq: T10 round 8, Layer 4 task L4A-55 (the ledger's RE-5 and HO-C by method M-B): the quorum service of the three I/O
supervisors under every fault row, the vote path's latent faults, the recovery proof and FW-B22 restated on the two fabrics
(MESHSAT-1357; desk analysis on printed figures; prototype design, nothing built, bought, powered or measured; it closes nothing
until independently checked)

